date-released: "2026-08-15"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hopejsh/aaa-rns"
url: "https://github.com/hopejsh/aaa-rns"
# Zenodo issues two DOIs. The concept DOI always resolves to the newest
# release and is what a reader normally wants; the version DOI is frozen to a
# single release and is what you cite when the exact bytes matter — a
# reproducibility statement, for instance.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21937754
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21937754
    description: Concept DOI — always resolves to the latest release
  # 이 항목은 릴리스마다 손으로 갱신해야 한다: 새 버전 DOI 는 태그를 민 뒤
  # Zenodo 웹훅이 발급하므로, 릴리스 시점의 CI 는 이 값을 강제할 수 없다.
  # v2.0.1 이 이 갱신을 놓쳤고, 그래서 이 주석이 있다.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21955354
    description: Version DOI — permanently fixed to v2.1.0 (this release)
  - type: other
    value: "RRID:SCR_028836"
    description: Research Resource Identifier — cite this inline in a Methods section
